// C: 큰 흰 셔츠와 두 양말, 가는 처진 줄과 밝은 어깨 접힘만으로 또렷하게.
@size 32 16
@cell 16
@palette palette.pal
@mat a linen 2
@mat b linen 3
@mat c linen 4
@mat d linen 5
@mat e linen 6
@mat r pine 2
@mat s pine 3
@mat p pine 4
@mat q pine 5
@mat n iron 3
@layer line
@mblock 0 1
= 1n 30. 1n
= 1r 5s 20. 5s 1r
= 6. 20s 6.
@layer clothes
@mblock 3 4
= 3. 1b 3d 2. 3d 1b 3.
= 2. 1b 3e 1c 2b 3d 1c 1b 2.
= 1. 1b 4e 5d 3c 1b 1.
= 1b 4d 1e 5d 4c 1b
= 1b 2d 1b 1e 6d 1c 1b 2c 1b
= 1a 2b 1. 1e 6d 1c 1b 1. 2a
= 3. 1b 1e 6d 1c 1a 3.
= 3. 1b 7d 1c 1a 3.
= 3. 1b 6d 2c 1a 3.
= 3. 1b 5d 1c 2d 1a 3.
= 3. 1b 8c 1a 3.
= 3. 1a 8b 1a 3.
@mblock 21 5
bdb...bdb
edc...ddc
edc...ddc
edc...ddc
edc...ddc
edc...ddc
eddcb.ddc
.bdda.ddcb
..aaa.bdda
.......aa
@layer pegs
@mblock 6 3
q.......q.......q....q
p.......p.......p....p
